---
description: Database migration safety — reversible changes, explicit approval for destructive schema edits.
globs: "**/migrations/**, **/migrate/**, **/*.sql"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Database migrations

- Every migration must be reversible or document why rollback requires manual steps.
- Never alter a column type in-place when a expand-contract migration is safer.
- Do not drop tables or columns without explicit approval.
- Keep migrations small; one logical change per file when possible.
